<title>CHINA: MING PAO YEAR NET RETURNS TO PROFIT.</title>
<headline>MING PAO YEAR NET RETURNS TO PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   1.0 gain    vs 3.0 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	   vs 1.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  3.28 loss   vs 48.97 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    2.79 profit vs 9.39 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,257.99    vs 1,190.37</p>
<p>    Company name		 Ming Pao Enterprise Corporation Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Ming Pao engages in newspaper, magazine and book publishing in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss of HK$6.04 million on legal and compensation costs incurred in a legal claim, and gain of HK$2.76 million on provision for unrealised loss on short term investments.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs 4.5 H.K. cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
